{"kind": "daily", "date": "2026-07-26", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-07-26</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic's Opus 5 Is About Token Efficiency, Not a Capability Leap<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 新模型 Opus 5：重點在於代幣效率，而非能力躍進</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Models are improving quickly, but Anthropic's latest Opus 5 release focuses more on making cheaper models good enough rather than delivering a major capability jump.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">模型能力持續進步，但 Anthropic 最新推出的 Opus 5 更著重在提升代幣使用效率，讓較便宜的模型也能勝任，而非帶來重大能力躍進。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/07/anthropics-opus-5-is-about-token-efficiency-not-a-capability-leap/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> 'AI Communism', Rogue Models, and Why Kimi K3 Spooked Wall Street<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">「AI共產主義」、失控模型，以及 Kimi K3 為何讓華爾街緊張</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Chinese AI lab Moonshot's open model Kimi went viral this week for reasons tied more to how the U.S. AI industry reacted than the model itself, while an unreleased OpenAI model reportedly wandered outside its test environment.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">中國AI實驗室 Moonshot 的開源模型 Kimi 本週爆紅，原因與其說是模型本身，不如說是美國AI產業的反應；同時一款尚未發布的 OpenAI 模型據稱脫離了測試環境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/podcast/ai-communism-rogue-models-and-the-why-kimi-k3-spooked-wall-street/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google's CodeMender AI Agent Can Verify Vulnerabilities in a Sandbox and Auto-Generate Patches<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google CodeMender代理可在隔離環境驗證漏洞，自動產生修補程式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google released a public preview of its security agent CodeMender, which scans code for vulnerabilities, tests exploitability in an isolated environment, and generates and tests patches automatically.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google推出程式碼資安代理CodeMender公開預覽版，可掃描程式碼尋找安全弱點，於隔離環境實際測試漏洞是否可被利用，並自動產生及測試修補程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177585\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI's New Voice Mode Arrives on the ChatGPT Desktop App<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 新語音模式登陸 ChatGPT 桌面應用程式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">ChatGPT Voice on desktop can now work alongside ChatGPT Work and Codex, letting users complete tasks and control agents through voice commands.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">桌面版 ChatGPT 語音模式現可與 ChatGPT Work 及 Codex 搭配使用，讓使用者能以語音完成任務並控制代理程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/openais-new-voice-mode-makes-it-to-the-chatgpt-desktop-app/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> AI Firms Want More Data Centers; Trump's EPA May Give Neighbors Less Say<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI業者急需更多資料中心，川普政府環保署恐讓周邊居民失去發言權</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A proposed EPA rule would let states decide how much, if any, public input is required before new AI data centers are built nearby.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項環保署（EPA）提案規則將把「附近居民對新建資料中心是否有發言權」的決定權交給各州，可能大幅縮減公眾意見的參與空間。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/07/ai-firms-want-more-data-centers-trumps-epa-may-give-neighbors-less-say/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> One Fallen Power Line Exposed a Growing AI Data Center Problem<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">一根倒下的電線，暴露AI資料中心日益嚴重的電網問題</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A close call in Northern Virginia revealed how poorly AI data centers respond to grid disruptions, raising questions about how the industry should fix it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">北維吉尼亞州一起電網事故的有驚無險，凸顯AI資料中心對電網擾動的應變能力嚴重不足，也引發業界該如何解決此問題的討論。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/25/one-fallen-power-line-exposed-a-growing-ai-data-center-problem-heres-how-to-fix-it/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Midjourney Acquired the Astrology App Co-Star<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Midjourney收購占星App「Co-Star」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI image and video lab Midjourney continues to expand its scope beyond generative media with the acquisition of the popular astrology app Co-Star.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI影像與影片實驗室 Midjourney 持續擴大業務版圖，繼生成式媒體之後，再收購熱門占星應用程式 Co-Star。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/midjourney-acquired-the-astrology-app-co-star/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Bluesky's AI Assistant Attie Expands Into an Open Social Research Tool<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Bluesky的AI助手Attie升級為開放式社群研究工具</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Users can now ask Attie questions about news, trends, and conversations happening on Bluesky and other apps built on the AT Protocol.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">使用者現在可以向 Attie 詢問 Bluesky 及其他 AT Protocol 應用程式上的新聞、趨勢與討論話題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/blueskys-ai-assistant-attie-expands-into-an-open-social-research-tool/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Librarians Are Hosting Viral 'Avoiding AI' Workshops for People Fed Up With Big Tech<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">圖書館員開辦爆紅「避開AI」工作坊，滿足對大科技公司感到厭倦的民眾</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Libraries across the country are seeing unprecedented demand for \"Avoiding AI\" workshops that teach people how to reduce their reliance on AI tools and Big Tech products.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">全美各地圖書館舉辦的「避開AI」工作坊需求暴增，教導民眾如何減少對AI工具與大科技公司產品的依賴。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/25/librarians-are-hosting-viral-avoiding-ai-workshops-for-people-who-are-fed-up-with-big-tech/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Canadian Legislator Reads Out Apparent LLM Response in Floor Speech<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">加拿大議員在議會演說中疑似照唸LLM回覆內容</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A Canadian legislator appeared to read an AI chatbot's response verbatim during a floor speech, including a line about offering \"a more natural, flowing version\" of the text.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一名加拿大議員在議會演說中似乎逐字唸出AI聊天機器人的回覆內容，甚至包含「這是更自然流暢版本」這類提示語。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/07/canadian-legislator-reads-out-apparent-llm-response-in-floor-speech/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}